  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Paso 4: Descarga de los datasets de evaluación\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# - Amazon Reviews Multi (español): 50 reseñas para medir latencia.\n",
    "# - WikiText-2: corpus estándar para calcular perplejidad.\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Cargando Amazon Reviews Multi (español)...\")\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    amazon_ds = load_dataset(\"mteb/amazon_reviews_multi\", \"es\", split=\"test\")\n",
    "except Exception as e1:\n",
    "    print(f\"Método 1 falló: {e1}\")\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        amazon_ds = load_dataset(\"amazon_reviews_multi\", \"es\", split=\"test\")\n",
    "    except Exception as e2:\n",
    "        print(f\"Método 2 falló: {e2}\")\n",
    "        amazon_ds = load_dataset(\n",
    "            \"json\",\n",
    "            data_files=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/mteb/amazon_reviews_multi/resolve/main/es/test.jsonl\",\n",
    "            split=\"train\",\n",
    "        )\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Total reseñas: {len(amazon_ds)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Columnas: {amazon_ds.column_names}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Ejemplo: {amazon_ds[0]}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Seleccionamos 50 reseñas para la medición de latencia\n",
    "resenas_latencia = [r[\"text\"] for r in amazon_ds.select(range(50))]\n",
    "print(f\"Reseñas seleccionadas para latencia: {len(resenas_latencia)}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# WikiText-2 para perplejidad\n",
    "print(\"Cargando WikiText-2...\")\n",
    "wikitext = load_dataset(\"wikitext\", \"wikitext-2-raw-v1\", split=\"test\")\n",
    "wikitext_text = \"\\n\".join([t for t in wikitext[\"text\"] if t.strip()])\n",
    "print(f\"WikiText-2 cargado: {len(wikitext_text)} caracteres\")\n"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Paso 5: Definición de funciones de medición\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Cada función mide una dimensión de la evaluación comparativa:\n",
    "# - Tamaño en disco (via API de HuggingFace)\n",
    "# - Consumo de RAM y VRAM\n",
    "# - Latencia (tiempo por reseña y tokens/segundo)\n",
    "# - Perplejidad (sobre WikiText-2)\n",
    "\n",
    "def medir_tamano_modelo(model_name):\n"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Obtiene el tamaño del modelo en disco (GB) desde la API de HuggingFace.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "from huggingface_hub import model_info\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        info = model_info(model_name)\n",
    "        total = 0\n",
    "        if info.siblings:\n",
    "            for sibling in info.siblings:\n",
    "                if sibling.rfilename.endswith((\".safetensors\", \".bin\")):\n",
    "                    if sibling.size is not None:\n",
    "                        total += sibling.size\n",
    "        if total > 0:\n",
    "            return total / 1e9\n",
    "        if hasattr(info, \"safetensors\") and info.safetensors:\n",
    "            params = info.safetensors.get(\"total\", 0)\n",
    "            return (params * 2) / 1e9\n",
    "    except Exception as e:\n",
    "        print(f\"  ⚠️ No se pudo obtener tamaño via API: {e}\")\n",
    "    print(\"  Usando estimación por defecto\")\n",
    "    return 0.0\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def medir_ram_vram():\n"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Mide el consumo actual de RAM del proceso y VRAM de la GPU.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "ram = psutil.Process(os.getpid()).memory_info().rss / 1e9\n",
    "    vram = torch.cuda.memory_allocated() / 1e9 if torch.cuda.is_available() else 0\n",
    "    vram_peak = torch.cuda.max_memory_allocated() / 1e9 if torch.cuda.is_available() else 0\n",
    "    return {\"ram_gb\": round(ram, 2), \"vram_gb\": round(vram, 2), \"vram_peak_gb\": round(vram_peak, 2)}\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def medir_latencia(model, tokenizer, resenas, max_new_tokens=30):\n"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Mide la latencia de inferencia sobre un conjunto de reseñas.\n",
    "    Devuelve: tiempo medio por reseña, tokens/segundo y tiempo total.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "tiempos = []\n",
    "    tokens_generados = []\n",
    "    for i, resena in enumerate(resenas):\n",
    "        prompt = (\n",
    "            \"Clasifica el sentimiento de la siguiente reseña como positivo, \"\n",
    "            \"negativo o neutro. Responde únicamente con una palabra.\\n\\n\"\n",
    "            f\"Reseña: {resena}\\n\\nSentimiento:\"\n",
    "        )\n",
    "        inputs = tokenizer(\n",
    "            prompt, return_tensors=\"pt\", truncation=True, max_length=512\n",
    "        ).to(device)\n",
    "        if torch.cuda.is_available():\n",
    "            torch.cuda.synchronize()\n",
    "        t0 = time.time()\n",
    "        with torch.no_grad():\n",
    "            outputs = model.generate(\n",
    "                **inputs,\n",
    "                max_new_tokens=max_new_tokens,\n",
    "                do_sample=False,\n",
    "                pad_token_id=tokenizer.pad_token_id,\n",
    "            )\n",
    "        if torch.cuda.is_available():\n",
    "            torch.cuda.synchronize()\n",
    "        t1 = time.time()\n",
    "        n_tokens = outputs.shape[1] - inputs[\"input_ids\"].shape[1]\n",
    "        tiempos.append(t1 - t0)\n",
    "        tokens_generados.append(n_tokens)\n",
    "        if (i + 1) % 10 == 0:\n",
    "            print(f\"  Procesadas {i + 1}/{len(resenas)} reseñas...\")\n",
    "    tiempo_total = sum(tiempos)\n",
    "    total_tokens = sum(tokens_generados)\n",
    "    return {\n",
    "        \"tiempo_medio_por_resena_s\": round(np.mean(tiempos), 3),\n",
    "        \"tokens_por_segundo\": round(total_tokens / tiempo_total, 2) if tiempo_total > 0 else 0,\n",
    "        \"tiempo_total_s\": round(tiempo_total, 2),\n",
    "        \"resenas_procesadas\": len(resenas),\n",
    "    }\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def medir_perplejidad(model, tokenizer, texto, max_length=512, stride=256):\n"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Calcula la perplejidad del modelo sobre un texto (WikiText-2).\n",
    "    Valores más bajos indican mejor capacidad predictiva.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "encodings = tokenizer(texto, return_tensors=\"pt\", truncation=True, max_length=50000)\n",
    "    input_ids = encodings.input_ids.to(device)\n",
    "    seq_len = input_ids.size(1)\n",
    "    print(f\"  Tokens totales WikiText-2: {seq_len}\")\n",
    "    nlls = []\n",
    "    n_chunks = 0\n",
    "    for begin in range(0, seq_len, stride):\n",
    "        end = min(begin + max_length, seq_len)\n",
    "        input_chunk = input_ids[:, begin:end]\n",
    "        target_chunk = input_chunk.clone()\n",
    "        if begin > 0:\n",
    "            overlap = begin + max_length - end\n",
    "            if overlap > 0:\n",
    "                target_chunk[:, :max_length - (end - begin)] = -100\n",
    "        with torch.no_grad():\n",
    "            outputs = model(input_chunk, labels=target_chunk)\n",
    "            nll = outputs.loss\n",
    "        if not torch.isnan(nll) and not torch.isinf(nll):\n",
    "            nlls.append(nll.item())\n",
    "        n_chunks += 1\n",
    "        if end == seq_len:\n",
    "            break\n",
    "    if not nlls:\n",
    "        print(\"  ⚠️ No se pudieron calcular NLLs válidos\")\n",
    "        return float(\"inf\")\n",
    "    ppl = np.exp(np.mean(nlls))\n",
    "    print(f\"  Chunks procesados: {n_chunks}, NLLs válidos: {len(nlls)}\")\n",
    "    return round(ppl, 2)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def limpiar_memoria():\n"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Libera memoria GPU y RAM entre ejecuciones de modelos.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "gc.collect()\n",
    "    if torch.cuda.is_available():\n",
    "        torch.cuda.empty_cache()\n",
    "        torch.cuda.reset_peak_memory_stats()\n",
    "    gc.collect()\n",
    "    time.sleep(2)\n"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Paso 6: Función principal de evaluación de un modelo\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Ejecuta todas las mediciones para un modelo dado y devuelve un diccionario resumen.\n",
    "\n",
    "def evaluar_modelo(nombre, repo, bnb_config):\n"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Evalúa un modelo en las cuatro dimensiones: tamaño, memoria, latencia y perplejidad.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "print(f\"\\n{'='*60}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"=== {nombre} ===\")\n",
    "    print(f\"{'='*60}\\n\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    print(\"Midiendo tamaño en disco...\")\n",
    "    tamano = medir_tamano_modelo(repo)\n",
    "    print(f\"Tamaño en disco (original float16): {tamano:.2f} GB\\n\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    limpiar_memoria()\n",
    "    mem_antes = medir_ram_vram()\n",
    "    print(f\"Memoria antes de cargar: {mem_antes}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    print(\"Cargando modelo (cuantización 4-bit con bitsandbytes)...\")\n",
    "    tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(repo, trust_remote_code=True)\n",
    "    if tokenizer.pad_token is None:\n",
    "        tokenizer.pad_token = tokenizer.eos_token\n",
    "        tokenizer.pad_token_id = tokenizer.eos_token_id\n",
    "\n",
    "    model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\n",
    "        repo,\n",
    "        quantization_config=bnb_config,\n",
    "        device_map=\"auto\",\n",
    "        trust_remote_code=True,\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    model.eval()\n",
    "    mem_carga = medir_ram_vram()\n",
    "    print(f\"Memoria después de cargar: {mem_carga}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    print(\"\\nMidiendo latencia (50 reseñas)...\")\n",
    "    latencia = medir_latencia(model, tokenizer, resenas_latencia)\n",
    "    print(f\"Latencia: {latencia}\")\n",
    "    mem_inferencia = medir_ram_vram()\n",
    "    print(f\"Memoria después de inferencia: {mem_inferencia}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    print(\"\\nMidiendo perplejidad (WikiText-2)...\")\n",
    "    ppl = medir_perplejidad(model, tokenizer, wikitext_text)\n",
    "    print(f\"Perplejidad: {ppl}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    resultado = {\n",
    "        \"modelo\": nombre,\n",
    "        \"tamano_disco_gb\": round(tamano, 2),\n",
    "        \"vram_carga_gb\": mem_carga[\"vram_gb\"],\n",
    "        \"vram_peak_gb\": mem_inferencia[\"vram_peak_gb\"],\n",
    "        \"ram_carga_gb\": mem_carga[\"ram_gb\"],\n",
    "        \"tokens_por_segundo\": latencia[\"tokens_por_segundo\"],\n",
    "        \"tiempo_medio_resena_s\": latencia[\"tiempo_medio_por_resena_s\"],\n",
    "        \"perplejidad\": ppl,\n",
    "    }\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n--- RESUMEN {nombre} ---\")\n",
    "    print(json.dumps(resultado, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False))\n",
    "\n",
    "    del model, tokenizer\n",
    "    limpiar_memoria()\n",
    "    return resultado\n"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Paso 7: Ejecución de la evaluación comparativa\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Se evalúa cada modelo por separado, liberando memoria entre ejecuciones.\n",
    "\n",
    "# LLaMA 3.1 8B Instruct\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    resultado_llama = evaluar_modelo(\n",
    "        \"LLaMA 3.1 8B Instruct\", MODELOS[\"LLaMA 3.1 8B Instruct\"], bnb_config\n",
    "    )\n",
    "except Exception as e:\n",
    "    print(f\"❌ ERROR en LLaMA: {e}\")\n",
    "    resultado_llama = None\n",
    "    limpiar_memoria()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Qwen 2.5 7B Instruct\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    resultado_qwen = evaluar_modelo(\n",
    "        \"Qwen 2.5 7B Instruct\", MODELOS[\"Qwen 2.5 7B Instruct\"], bnb_config\n",
    "    )\n",
    "except Exception as e:\n",
    "    print(f\"❌ ERROR en Qwen: {e}\")\n",
    "    resultado_qwen = None\n",
    "    limpiar_memoria()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Mistral 7B Instruct\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    resultado_mistral = evaluar_modelo(\n",
    "        \"Mistral 7B Instruct\", MODELOS[\"Mistral 7B Instruct\"], bnb_config\n",
    "    )\n",
    "except Exception as e:\n",
    "    print(f\"❌ ERROR en Mistral: {e}\")\n",
    "    resultado_mistral = None\n",
    "    limpiar_memoria()\n"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Paso 8: Tabla resumen de la evaluación comparativa\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 80)\n",
    "print(\"TABLA RESUMEN — SELECCIÓN DE LLM CUANTIZADO\")\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 80)\n",
    "\n",
    "resultados = {\n",
    "    \"LLaMA 3.1 8B\": resultado_llama,\n",
    "    \"Qwen 2.5 7B\": resultado_qwen,\n",
    "    \"Mistral 7B\": resultado_mistral,\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "resultados_ok = {k: v for k, v in resultados.items() if v is not None}\n",
    "\n",
    "if resultados_ok:\n",
    "    nombres = list(resultados_ok.keys())\n",
    "    header = f\"{'Métrica':<30}\" + \"\".join(f\"{n:>18}\" for n in nombres)\n",
    "    print(header)\n",
    "    print(\"-\" * len(header))\n",
    "    for key, label in [\n",
    "        (\"tamano_disco_gb\", \"Tamaño disco (GB)\"),\n",
    "        (\"vram_carga_gb\", \"VRAM carga (GB)\"),\n",
    "        (\"vram_peak_gb\", \"VRAM pico (GB)\"),\n",
    "        (\"ram_carga_gb\", \"RAM sistema (GB)\"),\n",
    "        (\"tokens_por_segundo\", \"Tokens/segundo\"),\n",
    "        (\"tiempo_medio_resena_s\", \"Tiempo/reseña (s)\"),\n",
    "        (\"perplejidad\", \"Perplejidad\"),\n",
    "    ]:\n",
    "        row = f\"{label:<30}\"\n",
    "        for n in nombres:\n",
    "            row += f\"{resultados_ok[n][key]:>18}\"\n",
    "        print(row)\n",
    "    print(\"=\" * len(header))\n"
   ],
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "# PARTE 2: PROMPTING Y EVALUACIÓN DEL RENDIMIENTO\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objetivo de esta fase**: evaluar el rendimiento de los tres modelos en la tarea de clasificación\n",
    "de sentimientos mediante seis técnicas de prompting.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Qué se evalúa**:\n",
    "- 18 combinaciones (3 modelos × 6 técnicas de prompting).\n",
    "- Sobre 200 reseñas en español del corpus Amazon Reviews Multi.\n",
    "- Con generación determinista (do_sample=False, greedy decoding).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Técnicas de prompting**:\n",
    "- Zero-shot: instrucción directa sin ejemplos.\n",
    "- One-shot: un ejemplo real (clase positiva).\n",
    "- Few-shot: tres ejemplos reales (uno por clase).\n",
    "- Chain-of-thought: razonamiento paso a paso antes de clasificar.\n",
    "- Role-based: asignación de un rol de experto en análisis de sentimientos.\n",
    "- Iterative: clasificación inicial + fase de revisión.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Métricas calculadas**:\n",
    "- F1 macro-promediada (indicador principal).\n",
    "- Accuracy.\n",
    "- Precision, recall y F1 por clase.\n",
    "- Matrices de confusión.\n",
    "- Intervalos de confianza al 95% (bootstrap, 1.000 remuestreos).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Nota**: Antes de ejecutar esta parte, reinicia el entorno de ejecución\n",
    "para liberar la memoria ocupada por la Parte 1.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
